 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In Dappleford, every ten years, everyone's age gets shuffled overnight.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "You keep your memories, but you might wake up four, or forty, or ninety-nine.",
   "tag": "[playful]",
   "pause": 0.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Last time, Grandpa Fennick woke up six and ran for the slide.",
   "tag": "[amused]",
   "pause": 0.16
  },
  {
   "text": "Rudy was twelve. Oskar was his best friend.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "The night before the shuffle, they sealed a pact with their secret handshake: whatever age we get, we stay best friends.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Oskar practiced being grown-up, just in case.",
   "tag": "[amused]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "“If I'm old, I'll be a cool one.”",
   "speak": "If I'm old, I'll be a cool one.",
   "voice": "oskar",
   "tag": "[confidently]",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Rudy woke up. His hands were tiny.",
   "tag": "[surprised]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "“Mama!”",
   "speak": "Mama!",
   "voice": "rudy",
   "tag": "[shouting]",
   "pause": 0.16
  },
  {
   "text": "He was two. Mom was nine, crying under the cookie jar.",
   "tag": "[amused]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "His sister was forty, and had already grounded everyone.",
   "tag": "[amused]",
   "pause": 0.14
  },
  {
   "text": "The doorbell rang. An old man stood there, a cane in one hand, a game controller in the other.",
   "tag": "[curious]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "He did their secret handshake with one shaky pinky.",
   "tag": "[softly]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "It was Oskar, seventy-eight.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.14
  },
  {
   "text": "And he kept the pact. He pushed Rudy's stroller, fed him peas with airplane noises, and let him chew the controller.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.16
  },
  {
   "text": "“Nine years, eleven months to go. Next time, I'm the baby.”",
   "speak": "Nine years, eleven months to go. Next time, I'm the baby.",
   "voice": "oldoskar",
   "tag": "[whispers]",
   "pause": 0.1
  }
 ],
